const lines=[['heart','01','The heart line','Emotion & connection','Traditionally associated with emotions, affection, and connection. Its shape is interpreted differently across palmistry traditions; it cannot establish someone’s feelings or relationship future.','Connection, empathy, and the ways people imagine affection.'],['head','02','The head line','Thought & imagination','Often interpreted as a symbol of thought, imagination, and approaches to decisions. Palm creases do not measure intelligence, personality, or mental health.','A metaphor for reflection, creativity, and curiosity.'],['life','03','The life line','Energy & experience','In traditional palmistry, this curve around the thumb is linked to vitality and life experiences. Its length does not predict lifespan or diagnose health.','A narrative of lived experiences, rather than a clock for life.'],['fate','04','The fate line','Direction & possibility','Sometimes associated with direction, work, and changing circumstances. Not everyone has a distinct central crease, and it does not determine career or destiny.','A prompt to reflect on choices and purpose, without forecasting outcomes.']];
